# Baby Chick Origami – Easy Inflatable Paper Chick Tutorial

> Learn how to make a cute Baby Chick Origami with one square sheet of paper. Follow the step-by-step diagram and inflate your paper chick at the end.

## **Overview**

Looking for a cute **Baby Chick Origami** to fold? This inflatable paper chick is made from **a single square sheet of paper** and transforms into a three-dimensional chick after you blow air into the model at the final step.

With its small beak, folded wings, little feet and rounded body, this **origami chick** is a fun paper-folding project for anyone who enjoys animal origami.

The model uses **20 illustrated steps**, including a sink fold, shaping the beak and head, and finally inflating the body.

